File Index

/App.tsx
Purpose: App component renders the main application container.

/auth-callback.ts
Purpose: Entry script for auth-callback.html — the login popup's landing page, and a SECOND vite entry (see vite.config.ts rollupOptions.input; without it the page 404s in the built image and login hangs to its timeout). Deliberately outside features/: it is a page entry like main.tsx, not part of the app bundle — no React, no game connection, so the tab actually playing is never touched. Parses the #auth_token fragment, strips it from the URL before anything else can read it, writes the token via authTokenStore (same origin ⇒ same localStorage the opener reads), then closes itself. Only self-closes when window.opener exists — a directly-navigated window would just look broken.

/env.d.ts
Purpose: Defines TypeScript types for Vite environment variables and imports.

/main.tsx
Purpose: This file serves as the main entry point for the React application, rendering the root component into the DOM.
